# RPi-Monitor official repository
# On Debian 12 (Bookworm) and later, apt-key has been removed.
# The key must be stored in /etc/apt/keyrings/ and referenced with signed-by.
# The install.sh script handles this automatically.
deb [signed-by=/etc/apt/keyrings/rpimonitor.gpg] https://giteduberger.fr rpimonitor/
